<Legal title="Support" path="/support/" description="Get help with myboutiki.">
<div class="box"><p style="margin:0"><b>Email us:</b> <a href="mailto:support@myboutiki.com">support@myboutiki.com</a><br>Or open the app → Menu → <b>Help &amp; support</b> to send us a message with a screenshot. We reply within 24 hours.</p></div>
<h2>Common questions</h2>
<p><b>How do I open a shop?</b> Tap Create new account, choose your country, store name, username, phone and password — or continue with Google or Apple.</p>
<p><b>How do I post an item?</b> Tap Sell, add up to 10 photos, a title, an optional price and a description.</p>
<p><b>How do buyers order?</b> Buyers message you in Inbox, call you, or tap Order on WhatsApp.</p>
<p><b>How do I delete my account?</b> Menu → Delete account. See <a href="/delete-account/">account deletion</a>.</p>
<div class="ar"><h2>الدعم</h2><p>راسلنا على support@myboutiki.com أو من التطبيق: القائمة ← المساعدة والدعم. نرد خلال 24 ساعة.</p></div>
